"about.h":["Studio haqida","О студии","About the studio"],"about.p":["PixelCore Studio — o'zbek foydalanuvchisini o'ylab o'yin va ilovalar yaratadigan mustaqil jamoa.","PixelCore Studio — независимая команда, создающая игры и приложения с мыслью об узбекском пользователе.","PixelCore Studio is an independent team making games and apps with Uzbek-speaking users in mind."],
"about.logoP":["Logotipimizdagi to'rtta bo'lak — to'rtta yo'nalish: o'yin, dizayn, texnologiya va jamoa. Markazdagi nuqta esa ularni birlashtiruvchi g'oya.","Четыре части логотипа — четыре направления: игра, дизайн, технологии и команда. Точка в центре — идея, которая их объединяет.","The four parts of our logo are four directions: play, design, technology and team. The dot in the center is the idea that unites them."],
